---
// src/components/features/landing/comp-hero.astro
---
<section id="top" class="snap-section hero-section">
  <div class="hero-glow-1"></div>
  <div class="hero-glow-2"></div>
  
  <div class="container hero-container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span>
        <span class="badge-text">Auditoría 100% Gratis para Emprendedores Hispanos</span>
      </div>
      
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Descubre qué está frenando las ventas de tu <span class="highlight-text">marca</span> y tu <span class="highlight-text">web</span>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        En solo 2 minutos, punto por punto: identifica qué te hace ver poco profesional online y qué debes arreglar primero. Sin tecnicismos, directo y totalmente gratis.
      </p>
      
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#audit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg-scale">
          Hacer mi auto-auditoría &rarr;
        </a>
        <a href="#offer" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg-scale">
          Pedir auditoría personal
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="hero-footer-note">
        <svg class="trust-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" width="20" height="20">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Hecha por un developer con 20+ años de experiencia — no una agencia de plantillas.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: transparent;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-slow);
    text-align: center;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Fondo de luces de neón decorativas */
  .hero-glow-1 {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10%;
    left: 20%;
    width: 45vw;
    height: 35vw;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(60px);
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-glow-2 {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0%;
    right: 20%;
    width: 40vw;
    height: 30vw;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.04) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(70px);
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 850px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 50px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .badge-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }

  .badge-text {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .highlight-text {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  :global([data-theme="brand"]) .highlight-text {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: #f5a524; /* Unificado al Ámbar de la marca */
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    max-width: 700px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .btn-lg-scale {
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-footer-note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .trust-icon {
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  :global([data-theme="brand"]) .trust-icon {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0% {
      transform: scale(0.95);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(252, 209, 22, 0.7);
    }
    70% {
      transform: scale(1);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(252, 209, 22, 0);
    }
    100% {
      transform: scale(0.95);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(252, 209, 22, 0);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }
    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .hero-actions .btn {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>
